@startuml trace-links
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false

package "requirement documents" {
  rectangle "PC-TASK-003" as r3
  rectangle "PC-TASK-004" as r4
  rectangle "PC-TASK-005" as r5
}

package "GitHub" {
  rectangle "requirement issue #12\nlabel: cumin/type/requirement\nbody names PC-TASK-003, PC-TASK-004" as i12
  rectangle "implementation issue #13\n(sub-issue, closed)" as i13
  rectangle "implementation issue #14\n(sub-issue, open)" as i14
  rectangle "pull request #15\n(merged)" as pr15
}

r3 <.. i12 : ID in the body
r4 <.. i12 : ID in the body
i12 --> i13 : sub-issue
i12 --> i14 : sub-issue
i13 --> pr15 : closed by

note bottom of r5
  No requirement issue names it:
  "not filed"
end note
@enduml
